		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>24-foot-tall, robed giant with pox-marked grey-white skin.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +7 (3d6) or 1 boulder (far) +7 (2d10), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Lunar Aura</strong>. Double near- sized cube centered on giant On turn, giant chooses aura: Waning. CHA 15+ to take hostile actions against giant or allies. Waxing. CHA 15+ or attack nearest creature for 1d4 rounds. Lycanthropes revert to man-beast form.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
